WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
JENNY BROWN: How do you
personalize your G Suite Admin

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.570
console to suit
your specific needs?

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.160
In this quick lab,
we've provided you

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.520
with an organization, G Suite
Labs, and a temporary G Suite

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.840
domain to work in.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.550
You will make some
basic modifications

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.950
to a G Suite Admin
console and then modify

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.300
the company profile.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.070
Let's get to it.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.500
So far in the lab, you've
removed and rearranged

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.170
some controls from the
Admin console dashboard.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.360
Here we are customizing
the company profile

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.190
and adding a support
message that users

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:30.410
will see when they can't sign
into their G Suite account.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.670
We've set a time zone relevant
to our users and select Manual

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:36.190
for new products, so that an
administrator must manually

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:39.430
add new products for
users to have access.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.380
In the lab, you will
also get the opportunity

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:45.340
to bulk add users using a
CSV file and to log in as one

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.530
of your newly created
users and experience it

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:49.000
from a user perspective.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.830
In case you're not
familiar, Qwiklabs

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:53.050
is an online
hands-on lab library

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.020
available 24 hours a
day, seven days a week,

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:59.440
with more than 150 labs on
every cloud topic from intro

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.970
to expert level.

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:03.820
Each lab helps you learn a
new skill in about 30 minutes

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:05.410
using Google Cloud.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:07.780
When you're ready, use this
link to take the lab we just

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:08.920
went through today.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.960
And when you're ready
to sign up for GCP,

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.230
use this link to apply a
$300 credit to your account.

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:15.382
We want to hear from you.

00:01:15.382 --> 00:01:17.590
Every week, we'll answer a
question from our viewers.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.500
So let us know what's on your
mind in the comments below.

